[32m+[m[32m### D-028: Cumulative return[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m- **Status:** Accepted · **Proposed by:** Claude Code (milestone 1) · **Date:** 2026-10-13[m
[32m+[m[32m- **Decision:** `cumulative_return(portfolio_values)` = V_T / V_0 − 1, a decimal. Same input rules as[m
